      47.85,
      380.89,
      538.02,
      472.36
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Subsection (4) of Section 20 of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978,I, Sarath Amunugama, Minister of Higher Education and Research, on being satisfied that the administration of the affairsof the Eastern University, Sri Lanka have been seriously dislocated and that the authorities of the said University havefailed to restore normal conditions, do by this Order appoint Professor Uma Coomaraswamy to be the CompetentAuthority with effect from July 1, 2015, for the purpose of exercising, performing or discharging in lieu of Vice-Chancellor thepowers, duties and functions respectively which have been conferred or imposed on, or assigned to the Vice- Chancellor ofthe Eastern University, Sri Lanka, under the said Act or any Order, Ordinance, Statute, By law, Regulation or Rule madethereunder.",
    "fonts": [
